# Leyline of Resonance: "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a);
# "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only a single creature you control, copy that spell. You may choose
# new targets for the copy." Bot1 begins with the Leyline out, plays Llanowar Elves, and casts Snakeskin Veil on it: the trigger
# copies the Veil (CR 707.10), the Elves are the only creature the copy could be aimed at, so it asks nothing and keeps them, and the Elves get a counter from each (2/2 -> 3/3).

